# ⭐ STEP 2 — Create a mapping of each unique MLS file number → unique prop_id

This ensures **only one MLS file gets each `prop_id`**.

```sql
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS #PropIDMap;

SELECT 
    mlsFNo,
    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY mlsFNo) AS prop_id
INTO #PropIDMap
FROM (
    SELECT DISTINCT mlsFNo FROM file_history_staging
    UNION
    SELECT DISTINCT mlsFNo FROM CofO_staging
    UNION
    SELECT DISTINCT mlsFNo FROM pic
) AS AllMLS;
```

✔ Now each unique `mlsFNo` has a unique `prop_id`
✔ No prop_id is repeated for different mlsFNo
✔ The mapping covers **ALL** MLS numbers across all tables

